{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"4f31d280b01abf830356e14f228f28bae5bd2e2440dce792314e730a5fea0344"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:b2c6b060c9aab253c8e1ebfc2162d90a95da373b5994fe4979f787b7e75759d0","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"National park","evidence":"[D10:12 | 8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023] Melanie: We always look forward to our family camping trip. We roast marshmallows, tell stories around the campfire and just enjoy each other's company. It's the highlight of our summer!\n[D10:14 | 8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023] Melanie: I'll always remember our camping trip last year when we saw the Perseid meteor shower. It was so amazing lying there and watching the sky light up with streaks of light. We all made wishes and felt so at one with the universe. That's a memory I'll never forget.","itemId":"urn:uuid:26343f60-22db-5bf7-aa22-560f6da84980","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:710df2d7e46608a7cfd6b1b7db9db2d0d70b1f06ba650ff004b74a0ad021ed9b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Melanie be more interested in going to a national park or a theme park?","referenceAnswer":"National park; she likes the outdoors","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"710df2d7e46608a7cfd6b1b7db9db2d0d70b1f06ba650ff004b74a0ad021ed9b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}